    "updated_at": "2026-04-14T18:22:23Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure that a placeholder label option is required in this case. When no options are selected, a `<select multiple size=1>` will have text which says \"0 selected\". Having an `<option value=\"\">` in this select doesn't seem to become selected by default or replace the \"0 selected\" text.\n\nDoes this make sense? Am I missing something?",
