    "created_at": "2026-06-09T12:41:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-09T12:41:47Z",
    "body": "> Regarding the title of this issue, I fail to understand why a placeholder option is required for single-select.\n\nMaybe I get it, is it because there needs to be at least one invalid selection state for `required` to make sense in a single-select?\nIf that's the reason, then I don’t think `select multiple size=1` needs the same requirement, because there is already a common invalid selection state, which is \"no options selected\".",
