    "body": "Thanks, sounds like we are on the same page!\n\nI'm not certain how this relates to the OP, which I am still struggling a bit to understand. Is the OP saying that all select elements must have placeholder options? Or does the spec already say that selects must have placeholder options somehow?\n\n> Another thing that would be nice is support for a placeholder option in select listboxes (size>1).\n\nIs there a good example of a listbox with a placeholder option out there on the web? As in something that doesn't actually use the select element. I can't think of a good use case for this.",
